  distinct iso classes among tilings: 4  (collapse 8->4)
  fiber sizes (tilings per class, =H/Aut): [5, 1, 1, 1]
  THM-354 verified on all tilings: good-cuts == n - #SCC  (assert passed)
  #SCC distribution over all tilings: {1: 5, 2: 2, 4: 1}
  arc-flip CONTEXT-DEPENDENCE (frac of contexts where flipping tile t
     changes the iso class), per tile [(0, 2), (0, 3), (1, 3)]:
     [0.5, 0.75, 0.5]
     -> NOT constant, NOT 1: an arc flip's effect depends on the other arcs.
  ROUND tilings (LRC-realizable, S523): 6 of 8
     their #SCC dist: {1: 5, 4: 1}; #upsets dist: {0: 1, 1: 1, 2: 3, 3: 1}

