READING: the 2^C(n-1,2) tile cube collapses massively onto iso classes;
a single arc flip is silent or expressive DEPENDING ON CONTEXT (varies by
tile and by the rest of the state). The ranking is a transitive chain of
#SCC anti-transitive strong blocks (THM-354). Arcs are not independent.
